# The runtime state of `empty_before.hex` in the shape after the migration.
# Written by hand.

94              # the runtime state: 4 elements
  90            # no ready frames
  92 00 80      # the promise states table: next id 0, no states
  91 92 00 80   # the select states table: one field, next id 0, no continuations
  00            # the effect counter
